break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はテレビ初披露です。楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今シングルたくさん盛り上げていきましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなた坂46曲「Empty」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVが24時に公開されます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらもお忘れなく🪼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202605/mobwAWQI1.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVの時の写真探してたら出てきた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふざけすぎ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-s46-39296":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"            こんばんは🦉　　ラジオ「さくみみ」#45 #46　井上と夏鈴ちゃんとおしゃべりしました！　　いやー、笑った！　いつもの私たちの会話、あんな感じです。楽しい。　　是非、きいてねー🥸　　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202105/mobAKWWZG.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　最近読んでいる本です。だいすきな世界、、🤔　　　小説のほうは、先日お仕事でプレゼントしていただいたものを読んでいるのでまたご紹介しますねぇ　　　　 美術館いきたいなぁ…クロード・モネの絵が好きです。　ほなね！櫻坂46 田村保乃　"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-65613":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこにあるんだろうねー\n見つけた方は教えてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。\n日向坂46の上村ひなのと申します。\n(*ˊ˘ˋ*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝からみんなと一緒に歌ったり踊ったりしてきました！\nツアー期間はいつも沢山頭を使うからか、通常時よりもぐんとお腹が空きやすくなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今食べたいものはパスタ🍝\nトマトクリー厶もいいけどいまはジェノベーゼとかの気分だよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ9月になってツアーのスタートも近付いてきました。\nより良いものにできるように全員で頑張ります！\n楽しみにしててね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚪︎15th single「お願いバッハ！」\nMVが公開中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/XYTjRxWe9Jc"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恋の始まりと音の高鳴りがリンクするような楽曲。MVもみんなの色んな表情を発見することができて素敵なんだ~\n是非ご覧ください🎻🎹"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ℹ️\nーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚪︎9/7(日)18:30〜\n文化放送「日向坂46の『ひ』」\n宮地すみれとお送りします📻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#日向ひ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚪︎9/7(日)25:20〜\nテレビ東京「日向坂で会いましょう」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＃日向坂で会いましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚪︎日向坂46全国ツアー2025\nARENA TOUR 2025「MONSTER GROOVE」ツアー特設サイト\nhttps://www.hinatazaka46.com/s/official/page/tour2025\n#MONSTERGROOVE2025\n#日向坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚪︎Instagram\nhinanokamimura.official\n#ひなのなのぐらむ\nhttps://www.instagram.com/hinanokamimura.official/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚪︎メッセージアプリ\n#ひなのなのとーく\nhttps://www.hinatazaka46.com/s/h46app/page_common/app_guide"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"︎⚪︎上村ひなの1st写真集「そのままで」発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚪︎書籍「へんてこスイッチ」発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202509/mobYcccxW.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋が楽しみだね( 'ᢦ' )みくにちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは本日のブログはこの辺りで！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜読んでくださってありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね( ・∇・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上村ひなの\n813,\n#ひなのなのぶろぐ"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-n46-101895":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"                    ﻿こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上和です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/b0c/bc7f9cd197da94cf3f6133c2f3eef.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9/14発売のヤングジャンプさんの表紙と巻頭グラビアを務めさせていただいています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤングジャンプさんに掲載していただくのは初めてです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディションのメディア賞での桜のグラビアも、17分間のフロント5人でのグラビアもすごく好きだったので嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また呼んでいただけるように頑張ります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/b0c/bc7f9cd197da94cf3f6133c2f3eef-01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"bre